{
  "title": "Taweez against Mouthache",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Imam al-Sadiq(a.s.) is reported to have said: As for those who suffer from mouth ache, they may put their hands on the ached organ and say the following:\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ بِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الَّذِىْ لَا يَضُرُّ مَعَ اسْمِهٖ دَاۤءٌ اَعُوْذُ بِكَلِمَاتِ اللّٰهِ الَّتِىْ لَا يَضُرُّ مَعَهَا شَيْءٌ قُدُّوْسٌ قُدُّوْسٌ قُدُّوْسٌ اَسْئَلُكَ يَا رَبِّ بِاسْمِكَ الطَّاهِرِ الْمُقَدَّسِ الْمُبَارَكِ الَّذِىْ مَنْ سَئَلَكَ بِهٖ اَعْطَيْتَهٗ وَ مَنْ دَعَاكَ بِهٖ اَجَبْتَهٗ اَسْئَلُكَ يَا اَللّٰهُ يَا اللّٰهُ يَا اللّٰهُ اَنْ تُصَلِّىَ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ النَّبِىِّ وَ اَهْلِ بَيْتِهٖ وَ اَنْ تُعَافِيَنِىْ مِمَّا اَجِدُ فِىْ فَمِىْ وَ فِىْ رَاْسِىْ وَفِىْ سَمْعِىْ وَ فِىْ بَصَرِىْ وَ فِىْ بَطْنِىْ وَ فِىْ ظَهْرِىْ وَ فِىْ يَدِىْ وَ فِىْ رِجْلِىْ وَ فِىْ جَوَارِحِىْ كُلِّهَا.\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEMI BISMIL LAAHIL LAZEE LAA YAZURRU MA'ASMIHEE DAA-UN A'OOZU BIKALIMAATIL LAAHIL LATEE LAA YAZURRU MA'AHAA SHAY-UN QUDDOOSUN QUDDOOSUN QUDDOOSUN AS-ALUKA YAA RABBI BISMIKAT TAAHIRIL MUQADDASIL MUBAARAKIL LAZEE MAN SA-ALAKA BIHEE A'TAYTAHOO WA MAN DA'AAKA BIHEE AJABTAHOO AS-ALUKA YAA ALLAAHU YAL LAAHU YAL LAAHU AN TUSALLIYA A'LAA MUHAMMADININ NABIYYI WA AHLI BAYTIHEE WA AN TU'AAFIYANEE MIMMAA AJIDU FEE FAMEE WA FEE RA'SEE WAFEE SAM'EE WA FEE BASAREE WA FEE BATNEE WA FEE ZAHREE WA FEE YADEE WA FEE RIJLEE WA FEE JAWAARIHEE KULLIHAA.\nIn the Name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful. In the Name of Allah, with Whose Name no illness can cause harm. I seek refuge in the words of Allah, with which nothing can cause harm. Most Holy! Most Holy! Most Holy! I beseech You, O Lord, in the name of Your pure, holy and blessed Name, with which whoever asks You, You give him, and whoever calls upon You, You answer him. I beseech You, O Allah, O Allah, O Allah, to send blessings to Muhammad the Prophet and his Household, and to heal me of what I feel in my mouth, my head, my hearing, my sight, my stomach, my back, my hand, my leg, and all of my limbs."
}
